    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-15",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This joint resolution nullifies the rule titled <em>Energy Conservation Program: Energy Conservation Standards for Consumer Gas-fired Instantaneous Water Heaters </em>and submitted by the Department of Energy (DOE) on December 26, 2024. Under the rule, DOE adopted amended energy conservation standards for gas-fired instantaneous water heaters to achieve the maximum improvement in energy efficiency that DOE determined was technologically feasible and economically justified.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-01-27T14:02:08Z"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-05-09",
        "action_desc": "Public Law",
        "text": "<p>This act nullifies the rule titled <em>Energy Conservation Program: Energy Conservation Standards for Consumer Gas-fired Instantaneous Water Heaters </em>and submitted by the Department of Energy (DOE) on December 26, 2024. Under the rule, DOE adopted amended energy conservation standards for gas-fired instantaneous water heaters to achieve the maximum improvement in energy efficiency that DOE determined was technologically feasible and economically justified.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-09-30T14:51:18Z"
      }
    ]
  },
